Input: {"question": "What position does Friedrich II. von Parsberg currently or formerly hold?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 13, "text": "Friedrich II."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 14, "end": 26, "text": "von Parsberg"}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 28, "end": 41, "text": "Friedrich II."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 42, "end": 135, "text": "von Parsberg (died 1461) was a German prince-bishop who held the position of diocesan bishop."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 136, "end": 157, "text": "Early Life and Career"}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 159, "end": 172, "text": "Friedrich II."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 173, "end": 235, "text": "von Parsberg was born into a noble family in the 14th century."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 236, "end": 365, "text": "Little is known about his early life, but it is recorded that he came from a prominent family in the region of Parsberg, Bavaria."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 366, "end": 382, "text": "Episcopal Career"}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 384, "end": 397, "text": "Friedrich II."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 398, "end": 505, "text": "von Parsberg was appointed as the Bishop of Eichstätt in 1437, a diocese located in the Kingdom of Bavaria."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 506, "end": 678, "text": "As the diocesan bishop, he was responsible for the spiritual and administrative leadership of the diocese, which included the cities of Eichstätt, Weißenburg, and Ellingen."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 679, "end": 725, "text": "According to historical records, Friedrich II."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 726, "end": 794, "text": "von Parsberg played an active role in the governance of his diocese."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 795, "end": 889, "text": "He was involved in the reform of the clergy and the promotion of education within his diocese."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 890, "end": 1016, "text": "He also worked to strengthen the relationship between the diocese and the secular authorities, including the Duchy of Bavaria."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1017, "end": 1047, "text": "Evidence of Diocesan Bishopric"}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1049, "end": 1062, "text": "Friedrich II."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1063, "end": 1150, "text": "von Parsberg's position as diocesan bishop is supported by multiple sources, including:"}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1152, "end": 1206, "text": "* The Catholic Encyclopedia, which lists Friedrich II."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1207, "end": 1265, "text": "von Parsberg as the Bishop of Eichstätt from 1437 to 1461."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1266, "end": 1269, "text": "[1]"}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1270, "end": 1317, "text": "* The German Wikipedia article on Friedrich II."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1318, "end": 1428, "text": "von Parsberg, which describes him as the \"Bischof von Eichstätt\" (Bishop of Eichstätt) during the same period."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1429, "end": 1432, "text": "[2]"}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1433, "end": 1504, "text": "* The website of the Diocese of Eichstätt, which includes Friedrich II."}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1505, "end": 1546, "text": "von Parsberg in its list of past bishops."}, "D1S28": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1547, "end": 1550, "text": "[3]"}, "D1S29": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1552, "end": 1592, "text": "These sources confirm that Friedrich II."}, "D1S30": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1593, "end": 1729, "text": "von Parsberg held the position of diocesan bishop, with responsibility for the pastoral care and governance of the Diocese of Eichstätt."}, "D1S31": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1730, "end": 1741, "text": "References:"}, "D1S32": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1743, "end": 1773, "text": "[1] The Catholic Encyclopedia."}, "D1S33": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1774, "end": 1781, "text": "(1913)."}, "D1S34": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1782, "end": 1792, "text": "Eichstätt."}, "D1S35": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1793, "end": 1884, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/en.wikisource.org\\/wiki\\/Catholic_Encyclopedia_(1913)\\/Eichstätt>"}, "D1S36": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1886, "end": 1907, "text": "[2] German Wikipedia."}, "D1S37": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1908, "end": 1915, "text": "(2022)."}, "D1S38": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1916, "end": 1929, "text": "Friedrich II."}, "D1S39": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1930, "end": 1943, "text": "von Parsberg."}, "D1S40": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1944, "end": 2021, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/de.wikipedia.org\\/wiki\\/Friedrich_II._von_Parsberg>"}, "D1S41": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2023, "end": 2048, "text": "[3] Diocese of Eichstätt."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 13, "text": "Friedrich II."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 14, "end": 26, "text": "von Parsberg"}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 28, "end": 41, "text": "