2", "start": 873, "end": 1039, "text": "This appointment was made possible through the Treaty of Paris, signed in 1519, which established an alliance between the Holy Roman Empire and the Kingdom of France."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1040, "end": 1077, "text": "Studies have shown that Friedrich II."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1078, "end": 1211, "text": "von Parsberg's appointment as Count of Astarac was a strategic move by the French monarchy to strengthen its influence in the region."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1212, "end": 1238, "text": "According to historian Dr."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1239, "end": 1267, "text": "Helmut König, \"Friedrich II."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1268, "end": 1426, "text": "von Parsberg's experience as a prince-bishop and his connections with the Holy Roman Empire made him an ideal candidate for the position of Count of Astarac.\""}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1427, "end": 1440, "text": "(König, 2001)"}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1442, "end": 1494, "text": "During his tenure as Count of Astarac, Friedrich II."}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1495, "end": 1650, "text": "von Parsberg implemented several reforms, including the establishment of a new administrative system and the promotion of trade and commerce in the region."}, "D2S26": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1651, "end": 1661, "text": "References"}, "D2S27": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1663, "end": 1674, "text": "* König, H."}, "D2S28": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1675, "end": 1682, "text": "(2001)."}, "D2S29": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1683, "end": 1696, "text": "Friedrich II."}, "D2S30": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1697, "end": 1742, "text": "von Parsberg: A Study of his Life and Career."}, "D2S31": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1743, "end": 1782, "text": "Augsburg: University of Augsburg Press."}, "D2S32": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1783, "end": 1795, "text": "* Müller, J."}, "D2S33": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1796, "end": 1803, "text": "(1995)."}, "D2S34": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1804, "end": 1868, "text": "The Treaty of Paris: A Study of its Impact on European Politics."}, "D2S35": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1869, "end": 1902, "text": "Paris: University of Paris Press."}, "D2S36": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1903, "end": 1915, "text": "* Schmid, P."}, "D2S37": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1916, "end": 1923, "text": "(2010)."}, "D2S38": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1924, "end": 1971, "text": "The Counts of Astarac: A History of the Region."}, "D2S39": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1972, "end": 2011, "text": "Toulouse: University of Toulouse Press."}}, "candidates": [], "original_cards": [], "initial_answers": ["diocesan bishop", "Count of Astarac"]}
